  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Ph 1201.02 Scope. This chapter shall apply to all persons whose activities come under the jurisdiction of the board and who engage in central prescription processing activities.\n\nSource. #9469, eff 5-16-09, EXPIRED: 5-16-17\n\nNew. #12485, eff 2-24-18",
